{%- comment -%}
  The hero of the home pages, included by the splash layout's hero partial (partials/hero.liquid) where the Astro Hero
  override rendered HomeHero. The hero is rendered with the page's body (home-body.liquid, between the comments
  <!--home-hero--> and <!--/home-hero-->), because the code worker highlights the code of page bodies only (it runs
  before the layout step) and the hero holds the AppHost builder's example: this writes that part of `content` here
  and sets `mc_html`, the rest of the body, for partials/markdown-content. A page without the markers gets the hero
  rendered here, its code not highlighted.
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- if content contains "<!--/home-hero-->" -%}
{%- assign hh_parts = content | split: "<!--/home-hero-->" -%}
{%- assign hh_hero = hh_parts | first | split: "<!--home-hero-->" | last -%}
{%- capture mc_html -%}{{ hh_parts | slice: 1, hh_parts.size | join: "<!--/home-hero-->" | raw }}{%- endcapture -%}
{{ hh_hero | raw }}
{%- else -%}
{% include "partials/home/home-hero-story.liquid" %}
{%- endif -%}
